      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"markdown\"><h4>数据范围</h4>\n<p>对于所有测试点，保证 <span class=\"katex math inline\">2 \\le n \\le 10</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">2 \\le m \\le 10</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\le a_{i,j} \\le 100</span>。</p>\n</div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
